+// .00000..........  denormals
+// .00001..........  -14 exponent
+// .11110..........   15 exponent
+// .111110000000000  infinity
+// .11111nnnnnnnnnn  NaN with n!=0
+// s...............  sign
+//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// FP16/INT16 ALIASING DENORMAL
+// ============================
+// 11-bit unsigned integers alias with half float denormal/normal values,
